error BYN2613: a panic handler reads only `let` bindings and parameters

  4 │     defer panicking (p) print($"{p.message}: {total} of {limit}, {count} done")
    │                                                                   ^^^^^ `count` is not a `let`
    │                                                                         or a parameter
    │
  help: copy the value into a `let` before the handler and read that
